      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#3 · the five ratified relations (all human-amplified: yes); A24; the Arbitration field",
          "title": "The ratified reading: the well at the centre; the olive chain",
          "italic": "The toroidal appointment embodies the theorem: the condition of the whole may remain present without becoming one more positive content of the governing form — wholeness through relation to an interior depth, not its filling.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The ratified relations carry the amplification. Poseidon's well/sea is read as the archaic-magical depth enshrined within the heart of Athena's rational-civic form — the strongest image toroidal rather than linear: the formed city organised around an opening it cannot convert into itself. Athena carries rational, strategic, civic and technical differentiation, healthy insofar as it can contain relation to what it did not become; the danger lies in a reading declaring the whole field identical with the winning determination. The torus with Poseidon's well at its centre is a project-composed",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "image beside the mature torus/Ouroboros field — the condition of the whole may remain present without becoming one more positive content of the governing form. The olive chain runs root, tree, fruit, pressing, oil, anointing, flame and light — materially grounded, and inside this story the gift through which Athena's claim is witnessed, preferred and made civic; its later Epi-Logos technical appointment remains open. And: a judgment can bind, a city can receive a name, yet hybris begins when the achieved determination retroactively claims that what it did not choose never belonged to the field.\n\nOccurrences: the well at the centre (#1, #3); the olive under witness and its chain (#1, #3); the flood as retained force (#2, #3); the verdict's bounded authority (#1, #3).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
