      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#5→0 · A24's ratified return; the Arbitration/Hybris/Regard/Anamnesis field at register 3",
          "title": "The verdict returns to the place",
          "italic": "The whole returns-to A24 with the distinction a decision that binds from the claim that its result exhausts the place — the five unratified candidates kept visible without canonisation.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The whole returns-to A24 through the real competence of a verdict whose consequence remains within a larger field: retaining Poseidon's sign does not revoke Athena's award. The Arbitration field qualifies the return at operational register 3: Continuity-in-Indeterminacy keeps the place's prior relations available; Criterion-through-Distinction and Delineation-through-Difference expose what counts; Arbitration-in-Crisis binds; Con-text-through-Diaphaneity lets the determination be seen with its contrary; Resolution-in-Reconciliation returns the civic orientation with its history. The whole is close to the",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "Topos→Logos→Nomos→Natio fourfold as operational analogy, not a claim that the myth encoded the later sixfold. Athena's name becomes the civic noun while Poseidon's continued force shows the noun does not exhaust the living character of the place. The five candidate readings — Cecrops as psychoid mediator, two modes of power, the flood as return of excluded force, the two namings, the Erechtheion as complexio oppositorum — remain deliberately human-amplified: no, presented for encounter rather than installed as canon. Seven source houses carry the eight passage cards; print collation remains separate work.\n\nOccurrences: the retained contrary in the sanctuary (#2, #5→0); the verdict and its bounded authority (#1, #5→0); the candidates held unratified (#5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
